## Vocabulary data is not covered by this license

This license applies to the source code in `src/`, `scripts/`, `tests/`,
`index.html`, `styles.css` and `sw.js`.

The word inventory in `data/words.json` derives from *The Oxford 3000* PDF
supplied by the project owner. No Oxford affiliation, endorsement, or permission
for public redistribution is asserted, and the source PDF is not part of the web
distribution.

The IPA, translation and example content in `data/enrichment.json` and
`data/ipa.json` derives from third-party sources (ipa-dict, cmudict-ipa,
WikDict, Wiktionary/DBnary) under their own licenses. See
`THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md` and `licenses/`.

## Content is not human-reviewed

Enriched cards are AI-assisted drafts (`reviewStatus: draft`). Completeness of a
card is not a claim of human linguistic or editorial review.
